# Needs: instructorToken, otherInstructorToken, studentToken, outsiderToken, studentId, outsiderId (from 00-auth)
# Course rules: code 7-20 chars (trimmed + uppercased), name 10-120 chars, up to 40 students per request.

### Create course unauthenticated -> 401
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{host}}/api/course
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "CSX4107", "name": "Unauthenticated course" }

> {% client.test("401", () => client.assert(response.status === 401, `got ${response.status}`)); %}

### Create course as student -> 403
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{host}}/api/course
Cookie: qd_session={{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "CSX4107", "name": "Student made course" }

> {% client.test("403", () => client.assert(response.status === 403, `got ${response.status}`)); %}

